<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_NhlITxC5vkCkoDmvPnWDHw" name="us-gaap:DebtDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_zHLLX6Yy6EWr7KZVnIax_Q" continuedAt="Tb_zHLLX6Yy6EWr7KZVnIax_Q_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">NOTE&#160;10&#8212;DEBT</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;padding-bottom:12pt;margin:0pt;">Sustainability-linked credit facility and revolving line of credit</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On January 24, 2025 (the &#8220;Closing Date&#8221;), SES Holdings and Select LLC entered into a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lFaXNZ0-YkK_upxQgFctdg" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_I9CWCUI8P0S5mrV3BB57GA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_J_ul90mS7E26xMP4tEsRyQ">550.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million sustainability-linked senior secured credit facility (the &#8220;Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility&#8221;), by and among SES Holdings, as parent, Select LLC, as borrower and certain of SES Holdings&#8217; subsidiaries, as guarantors, each of the lenders party thereto and Bank of America, N.A., as administrative agent, issuing lender and swingline lender (the &#8220;Administrative Agent&#8221;), which initially provides for $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lFaXNZ0-YkK_upxQgFctdg" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_G7Ewtw7K-UOqZnMd936HjA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_PeybYV4TMEuU6YuRh0l-tA">300.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million in revolving commitments (the &#8220;Revolving Credit Facility&#8221;) and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lFaXNZ0-YkK_upxQgFctdg" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_TermLoanFacilityMember_t5mAWomacUaB4b4J183WbA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_E2GO8Y2UU0C8L78Ianyyjw">250.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million in term commitments (the &#8220;Term Loan Facility&#8221;), in each case, subject to a borrowing base. The Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility also has a sublimit of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lFaXNZ0-YkK_upxQgFctdg" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_LetterOfCreditMember_3_he26QHhUiCYhEWiBFVvQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_S7TiAtf2okmMN6bn8ht5xA">50.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million for letters of credit and a sublimit of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lFaXNZ0-YkK_upxQgFctdg" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtTypeAxis_us-gaap_BridgeLoanMember_f9EWaEoApUO51LxCV0GvTw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_MMT7LTq-8E2A8eOyn4mjyQ">30.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million for swingline loans.&#160;Subject to obtaining commitments from existing or new lenders, Select LLC has the option to increase the maximum amount under the senior secured credit facility by (i) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lFaXNZ0-YkK_upxQgFctdg" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_PKpZoXCg-0mpilDyABNO7g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:LineOfCreditFacilityContingentIncreaseAdditionalBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_PeaHnP937UeuDW_1DlR70g">150.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million for additional revolving commitments and (ii) $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lFaXNZ0-YkK_upxQgFctdg" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_wttr_FirstFourYearsMember_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_TermLoanFacilityMember_cNRw4i4Z40WZYkV1TFPpvw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:LineOfCreditFacilityContingentIncreaseAdditionalBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_3x2SMn3rGUOCFCWRK9qDLg">50.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million for additional term commitments, in each case, during the first four years following the Closing Date.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 11pt 0pt;">The Borrowing Base for the Revolving Credit Facility is calculated as the sum of (i)&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_wttr_BorrowingBaseAxis_wttr_EligibleInvestmentGradeBilledReceivablesMember_dIoMMvs5BEG95T2hbh62TQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralPercentOfAsset" scale="-2" id="Narr_4YyG_iLX00aSKyChzZ0NpQ">90</ix:nonFraction>% of the Eligible Investment Grade Billed Receivables, plus (ii)&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_wttr_BorrowingBaseAxis_wttr_EligibleBilledReceivablesMember_sZuBmiQuZke43QjK6MeeZw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralPercentOfAsset" scale="-2" id="Narr_jfY147FKVkO7r8Ze5qU87Q">85</ix:nonFraction>% of the Eligible Billed Receivables (other than Eligible Investment Grade Billed Receivables), plus (iii)&#160;the lesser of (a)&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_wttr_BorrowingBaseAxis_wttr_EligibleUnbilledReceivablesMember_kIlrxZROOkSi9RzE-V2yvg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralPercentOfAsset" scale="-2" id="Narr_6Rz-Y3ROTUmIH5YZFUKaLA">75</ix:nonFraction>% of the amount of Eligible Unbilled Receivables and (b)&#160;an amount equal to&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_PKpZoXCg-0mpilDyABNO7g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralBorrowingBasePercentOne" scale="-2" id="Narr_-0_PuchcF0-U8qYdeXCQEw">40</ix:nonFraction>% of the Borrowing Base, plus (iv)&#160;the least of (x)&#160;the product of&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_wttr_BorrowingBaseAxis_wttr_EligibleInventoryMember_UhK_cEFMQ0qKzU1ZVp07Eg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralPercentOfAsset" scale="-2" id="Narr_o_GeGKwUQke61w8CnNHHbw">70</ix:nonFraction>% multiplied by the value of Eligible Inventory at such time, (y)&#160;the product of&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_wttr_BorrowingBaseAxis_wttr_NetRecoveryPercentageMember_UDZ4WnZQSU-VGLGpVzz0Fw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralPercentOfAsset" scale="-2" id="Narr_woeBfY3A3kKj5MeozFf-Tg">85</ix:nonFraction>% multiplied by the Net Recovery Percentage identified in the most recent Acceptable Appraisal of Inventory, multiplied by the value of Eligible Inventory at such time and (z)&#160;an amount equal to&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_PKpZoXCg-0mpilDyABNO7g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralBorrowingBasePercentTwo" scale="-2" id="Narr_OIRl64Yfzkus2plWotE-uw">30</ix:nonFraction>% of the Borrowing Base, minus (v)&#160;the aggregate amount of Reserves, if any, established by the Administrative Agent from time to time. As of December 31, 2025, the Borrowing Base for the Revolving Credit Facility under the Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lFaXNZ0-YkK_upxQgFctdg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_wttr_BorrowingBaseAxis_wttr_BorrowingBaseMember_jG6EqgLPSk6uMpJYtHu5KQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_wRn08NV0fEyHRrMziXzC-g">235.1</ix:nonFraction> million. The Borrowing Base is calculated on a monthly basis pursuant to a borrowing base certificate delivered by Select LLC to the Administrative Agent.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">The Term Advance Borrowing Base for the Term Loan Facility is calculated as the lesser of (i)&#160;the product of&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_TermLoanFacilityMember_wttr_BorrowingBaseAxis_wttr_NetBookValueOfAllMEMember_0wXXJEpbGEyhT1aIZctdkw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralPercentOfAsset" scale="-2" id="Narr_J3pDP0HYc0CAko8ROPtB7Q">100</ix:nonFraction>% multiplied by the net book value of all Machinery and Equipment (&#8220;M&amp;E&#8221;) and (ii)&#160;the product of&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_TermLoanFacilityMember_wttr_BorrowingBaseAxis_wttr_NolvIpOfTermAdvanceCollateralMember_WUwHe1q6iUGhzMLOaeYpnA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralPercentOfAsset" scale="-2" id="Narr_OgO6ihYo0EelWolf53q6MQ">65</ix:nonFraction>% multiplied by the net orderly liquidation value &#8211; in place (&#8220;NOLV-IP&#8221;) of the Term Advance Collateral. As of the Closing Date, the Term Advance Borrowing Base under the Term Loan Facility was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lFaXNZ0-YkK_upxQgFctdg" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_TermLoanFacilityMember_t5mAWomacUaB4b4J183WbA" decimals="-4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:LineOfCreditFacilityBorrowingBase" scale="6" id="Narr_G_lY8ZADvUuIQ0WwvjlTjg">426.3</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million. The Term Advance Borrowing Base is thereafter only subject to reporting and redetermination during the period commencing after the date that excess availability is less than the greater of (a)&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_TermLoanFacilityMember_OYH31ejqHke8kPCTWtyjew" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:LineOfCreditFacilityBorrowingLimitPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_A9Q3JaQZFkO5iZ96T7KUlA">25</ix:nonFraction>% of the lesser of (1)&#160;the aggregate revolving commitments and (2)&#160;the then-effective borrowing base (such lesser amount, the &#8220;Borrowing Limit&#8221;) and (b)&#160;$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lFaXNZ0-YkK_upxQgFctdg" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_TermLoanFacilityMember_t5mAWomacUaB4b4J183WbA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:LineOfCreditFacilityBorrowingLimit" scale="6" id="Narr_HtAK4rKB0ke4tqm9Prr_TA">30.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million for&#160;<span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_uZ7FhXggKEGvzJoJRXO66Q;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">three</span></span>&#160;or more consecutive business days and ending on the first date that excess availability has equaled or exceeded the greater of (1)&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_TermLoanFacilityMember_OYH31ejqHke8kPCTWtyjew" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:LineOfCreditFacilityBorrowingLimitPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_sEbUCPlD60SxjlK45CG-fw">25</ix:nonFraction>% of the Borrowing Limit and (2)&#160;$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lFaXNZ0-YkK_upxQgFctdg" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_TermLoanFacilityMember_t5mAWomacUaB4b4J183WbA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:LineOfCreditFacilityBorrowingLimit" scale="6" id="Narr_-auB8IbcGku1ThMAyXoCsg">30.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million for&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_TermLoanFacilityMember_OYH31ejqHke8kPCTWtyjew" format="ixt-sec:durday" name="wttr:LineOfCreditFacilityLookBackPeriodRedeterminationEnding" id="Narr_7TBTwF3MykezjrI68HfH6Q">30</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;consecutive days.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:3pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">Borrowings under the Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility bear interest, at Select LLC&#8217;s election, at either Term SOFR (subject to a&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_MxSkVp5qBkGwZSrQfq94qg" decimals="2" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="wttr:DebtInstrumentFloorRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_nAbfyDDQ7ECvXHhmnNirdg">zero</ix:nonFraction>&#160;percent floor) or the Base Rate (&#8220;Base Rate&#8221; being equal to the greater of (a)&#160;the Prime Rate for such day; (b)&#160;the Federal Funds Rate for such day, plus&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_FederalFundsEffectiveSwapRateMember_hsd4gIrUEEqk_SuoxMozAw" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_cKqNXddXb0mmSVokUDp0_Q">0.50</ix:nonFraction>%; or (c)&#160;Term SOFR for a one month Interest Period as of such day, plus&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_SecuredOvernightFinancingRateSofrMember_on5wKQWSFES7v3K0FArChQ" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_3Bn8LANLFUiwSsFMV0ZxUw">1.0</ix:nonFraction>%), in each case plus an applicable margin. The applicable margin for Term SOFR loans under the Term Loan Facility ranges from&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_TermLoanFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_SecuredOvernightFinancingRateSofrMember_bkCL1evVHEG4JhFMglb1mA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_sRSV8UHfnECpRh8MhIUUzg">3.00</ix:nonFraction>% to&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_TermLoanFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_SecuredOvernightFinancingRateSofrMember_f7sCnYGOgkiVOp3oyoZU-w" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_eobdy3Po3Ue0uu_KiJWa4Q">3.50</ix:nonFraction>% and the applicable margin for Base Rate loans under the Term Loan Facility ranges from&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_TermLoanFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_BaseRateMember_LU-wpUq900yfXRPFNg4PaQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_TKTP9IkuEESr7m4BTF332A">2.00</ix:nonFraction>% to&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_TermLoanFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_BaseRateMember_8bQl6BwBYUyZFEbH9WcUjg" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_i_CwSER_zkSs0LKW9yL-iA">2.50</ix:nonFraction>%, in each case, depending on Select LLC&#8217;s average excess availability under the Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility. Additionally, the applicable margin for Term SOFR loans under the Revolving Credit Facility ranges from&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_SecuredOvernightFinancingRateSofrMember_BLNKMGR8ykOJ06r-hmPs8A" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_1p07CDQvuEqDvIFYbJGzQA">1.50</ix:nonFraction>% to&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_SecuredOvernightFinancingRateSofrMember_dSrnWpIyG0y0mIyQoXhvPA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_v61dQHWyK0e9JVO0XN-O-w">2.00</ix:nonFraction>% and the applicable margin for Base Rate loans under the Revolving Credit Facility ranges from&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_BaseRateMember_VYTapFu_bkW366e0TxKReQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_azwOByi4GkazmJD1SWQAgQ">0.50</ix:nonFraction>% to&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_BaseRateMember_E3A5_9aw6kilCIUimgI5_w" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_orPyi_WkkEm991OwIzzwVA">1.00</ix:nonFraction>%, in each case, depending on Select LLC&#8217;s average excess availability under the Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility. Interest is payable monthly in arrears for Base Rate loans and, for Term SOFR loans, at the end of each applicable Interest Period, which may be one month or three months at Select LLC&#8217;s election. A commitment fee accrues on the unused commitments under the Revolving Credit Facility at either&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_w-kEQc7W8Uea_mEwS5uCAw" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityUnusedCapacityCommitmentFeePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_gls-1M04bEW_ZyWJNzzkJw">0.25</ix:nonFraction>% per annum or&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_us-gaap_RevolvingCreditFacilityMember_qOt8ouY4BUy6ZJ_XS7ubbw" decimals="5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityUnusedCapacityCommitmentFeePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_Rv20y7_zpUixX5VFxLjxqA">0.375</ix:nonFraction>% per annum depending on Select LLC&#8217;s average utilization of the Revolving Credit Facility in the preceding calendar month and is payable monthly in arrears. The Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility is scheduled to mature on the fifth anniversary of the Closing Date or the earlier termination in full of the Commitments.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;padding-top:3pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-32</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_zHLLX6Yy6EWr7KZVnIax_Q_cont1" continuedAt="Tb_zHLLX6Yy6EWr7KZVnIax_Q_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Under the Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility, the interest rate margin and the facility fee rates are also subject to annual adjustments based on the Select LLC&#8217;s performance of specified sustainability target thresholds with respect to (i)&#160;total recordable incident rate, as the Employee Health and Safety Metric, and (ii)&#160;barrels of recycled produced water recycled at facilities of the Credit Parties, as the Water Stewardship Metric, in each case, subject to limited assurance verification by a qualified independent external reviewer. The adjustment for the interest rate margin is a range of plus and minus&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_I9CWCUI8P0S5mrV3BB57GA" decimals="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebtPercentageBearingVariableInterestRate" scale="-4" id="Narr_DLQxjdFnP0aqCkpQi1BoWQ">5.00</ix:nonFraction>&#160;basis points and the adjustment for the commitment fee rate is a range of plus and minus&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_MxSkVp5qBkGwZSrQfq94qg" decimals="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityUnusedCapacityCommitmentFeePercentage" scale="-4" id="Narr_MBoCzD_4l0inSuHHDVmFAw">1.00</ix:nonFraction>&#160;basis point, subject to the mechanics under the Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility. As of the Closing Date, the margin adjustment in effect is a reduction of&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_I9CWCUI8P0S5mrV3BB57GA" decimals="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebtPercentageBearingVariableInterestRate" scale="-4" id="Narr_9jQQMssRX0aSTCmYRNmgdw">5.00</ix:nonFraction>&#160;basis points and the commitment fee adjustment in effect is a reduction of&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_MxSkVp5qBkGwZSrQfq94qg" decimals="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityUnusedCapacityCommitmentFeePercentage" scale="-4" id="Narr_8Dxt2VH0gEW_5GY6LzA01Q">1.00</ix:nonFraction>&#160;basis point.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">The obligations under the Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility are guaranteed by SES Holdings and certain subsidiaries of SES Holdings and Select LLC and secured by a security interest in substantially all of the personal property assets of SES Holdings, Select LLC and their domestic subsidiaries that are guarantors.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">The Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility contains certain customary representations and warranties, affirmative and negative covenants and events of default. If an event of default occurs and is continuing, the lenders may declare all amounts outstanding under the Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility to be immediately due and payable.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">In addition, the Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility restricts SES Holdings&#8217; and Select LLC&#8217;s ability to make distributions on, or redeem or repurchase, its equity interests, except for certain distributions, including distributions of cash so long as, both at the time of the distribution and after giving effect to the distribution, no default or event of default exists under the Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility or would result from the making of such distribution and (a)&#160;the fixed charge coverage ratio of SES Holdings is equal to or greater than&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_I9CWCUI8P0S5mrV3BB57GA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:FixedChargeCoverageRatio" scale="-2" id="Narr_3tRUW72QBUm8GQ75ho3dkg">1.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;to 1.0 on a pro forma basis, (b)&#160;the leverage ratio of SES Holdings is not greater than&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_In0iFbRhzUqV8-7sp81P6w" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:LeverageRatio" scale="-2" id="Narr_KqtPTDgLPk6YNDfYkFnD8w">3.5</ix:nonFraction>&#160;to 1.0 on a pro forma basis, (c)&#160;excess availability at all times during the preceding&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_MxSkVp5qBkGwZSrQfq94qg" format="ixt-sec:durday" name="wttr:LineOfCreditFacilityLookBackPeriodForDistributions" id="Narr_2EEhbCPQ0E62yV9_3RfGxg">30</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;consecutive days, on a pro forma basis and after giving effect to such distribution, is not less than the greater of (1)&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_I9CWCUI8P0S5mrV3BB57GA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:LineOfCreditFacilityPercentageOutstanding" scale="-2" id="Narr_tRlsZ5MPAkC4liTx6a4vkQ">20</ix:nonFraction>% of the Borrowing Limit and (2)&#160;$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lFaXNZ0-YkK_upxQgFctdg" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_I9CWCUI8P0S5mrV3BB57GA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:LineOfCreditFacilityBaseValueForDistributions" scale="6" id="Narr_fPI2VbxCoUCg_dwKfUx76A">27.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million. Additionally, the Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility generally permits Select LLC to make distributions required under its existing TRAs, subject to certain limitations.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">The Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility also requires SES Holdings to maintain (i)&#160;a fixed charge coverage ratio of at least&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_I9CWCUI8P0S5mrV3BB57GA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:FixedChargeCoverageRatio" scale="-2" id="Narr_3s-S_FkQN0WFM5OirhaDtA">1.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;to 1.0 and (ii)&#160;a leverage ratio of not more than&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_MxSkVp5qBkGwZSrQfq94qg" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:LeverageRatio" scale="-2" id="Narr_JaEvNSSUVkmX0ZuKoa3adQ">3.5</ix:nonFraction>&#160;to 1.0, in each case, as of the last day of any fiscal quarter.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Commencing on the first day of the calendar month immediately following the first full fiscal quarter ending after the first anniversary of the closing date, the Term Loan Facility will amortize in quarterly installments equal to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_lFaXNZ0-YkK_upxQgFctdg" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_In0iFbRhzUqV8-7sp81P6w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityPeriodicPayment" scale="6" id="Narr_EoksCYYlJEaTsheKM4myDg">15.625</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million (subject to reduction of such amount on account of certain prepayments). Upon the repayment in full of the Term Loan Facility, certain terms of the Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility will be automatically adjusted (including the conditions to the making of cash distributions and the financial maintenance covenants) and the Term Advance Collateral will be released as Collateral, in each case, as described in the Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">Certain lenders party to the Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility and their respective affiliates have from time to time performed, and may in the future perform, various financial advisory, commercial banking and investment banking services for the Company and its affiliates in the ordinary course of business for which they have received and would receive customary compensation. In addition, in the ordinary course of their various business activities, such parties and their respective affiliates may make or hold a broad array of investments and actively trade debt and equity securities (or related derivative securities) and financial instruments (including bank loans) for their own account and for the accounts of their customers, and such investments and securities activities may involve the Company&#8217;s securities and/or instruments.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In connection with the entry into the&#160;Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility, the obligations of SES Holdings, Select LLC and their applicable subsidiaries under the Prior Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility were repaid in full and the Prior Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility was terminated on the Closing Date.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-33</p></div></div>
