qn0vuB8A">270.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and a borrowing base that is determined by calculating the amount equal to the sum of (i)&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_3_17_2022_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_wttr_BorrowingBaseAxis_wttr_EligibleBilledReceivablesMember_v78Zd0SP30SgX3JtgbTI0w" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralPercentOfAsset" scale="-2" id="Narr_S2Gf5qpxd0Gm84s4Lw0iHg">85</ix:nonFraction>% of the Eligible Billed Receivables (as defined in the Prior Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility), plus (ii)&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_3_17_2022_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_wttr_BorrowingBaseAxis_wttr_EligibleUnbilledReceivablesMember_mJqLQ5FktEWtVvJyiSZS4w" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralPercentOfAsset" scale="-2" id="Narr_5o1WUER6-UKqcOq6oM-FPg">75</ix:nonFraction>% of Eligible Unbilled Receivables (as defined in the Prior Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility), provided that this amount would not equal more than&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_3_17_2022_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_Y1tUa3CKgUyfvaFK0p2mgQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralMaximumBorrowingBasePercent" scale="-2" id="Narr_K9wkV_XM3UuQxDoPdj3IHA">35</ix:nonFraction>% of the borrowing base, plus (iii)&#160;the lesser of (A)&#160;the product of&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_3_17_2022_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_wttr_BorrowingBaseAxis_wttr_EligibleInventoryMember_SxDR64n-2kWnmF077EIb8w" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralPercentOfAsset" scale="-2" id="Narr_VX2jc-UV30aaDlI_RfPNDA">70</ix:nonFraction>% multiplied by the value of Eligible Inventory (as defined in the Prior Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility) at such time and (B)&#160;the product of&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_3_17_2022_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_wttr_BorrowingBaseAxis_wttr_NetRecoveryPercentageMember_Qe8NB7pEkEu4Bkd7Ih6vYw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralPercentOfAsset" scale="-2" id="Narr_m9eOGt0Qo0egcCNZNoKGLg">85</ix:nonFraction>% multiplied by the Net Recovery Percentage (as defined in the Prior Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility) identified in the most recent Acceptable Appraisal of Inventory (as defined in the Prior Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility), multiplied by the value of Eligible Inventory at such time, provided that this amount would not equal more than&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_y9w4KTDqO0mgHUNiMjGnhw" contextRef="As_Of_3_17_2022_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_CreditFacilityAxis_wttr_SeniorSecuredCreditFacilityMember_9na7aRchjkqXYR61wUUEew" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="wttr:CollateralMaximumBorrowingBasePercent" scale="-2" id="Narr_bmOCdw1lR0yIe4h8VwtWNg">30</ix:nonFraction>% of the borrowing base, minus (iv)&#160;the aggregate amount of Reserves (as defined in the Prior Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility), if any, established by the Prior Administrative Agent from time to time, including, if any, the amount of the Dilution Reserve (as defined in the Prior Sustainability-Linked Credit Facility). The borrowing base was calculated on a monthly basis pursuant to a borrowing base certificate delivered by Select LLC to the Prior Administrative Agent.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text